{1}{Good day. What can I do for you?}{Good day. What can I do for you?}{}{}{}{ }
{2}{What do you sell here?}{}{5}{}{13}{ }
{3}{What yoo sell?}{}{-4}{}{13}{ }
{7}{What can you tell me about the man I'm after, Walter?}{}{5}{}{25}{ }
{8}{What you know 'bout Man in Black?}{}{-4}{}{25}{ }
{15}{Isn't it difficult making a living selling weapons in such a small town?}{}{5}{lf4 0}{20}{ }
{16}{Do you have any work for me?}{}{5}{lf4 1}{55}{ }
{17}{Me want job.}{}{-4}{lf4 1}{55}{ }
{18}{I'm still trying to locate the Dark River and Wink's burial place.}{}{5}{qu 1264 2}{60}{ }
{19}{Me still look for Dark River.}{}{-4}{qu 1264 2}{60}{ }
{23}{I've found the location of the Dark River and Wink's home.}{}{5}{qu 1264 3}{180}{ }
{24}{Me know where Dark River is!}{}{-4}{qu 1264 3}{180}{ }
{72}{I've got Wink's Mechanical Tophat.}{}{5}{in 3001}{100}{ }
{73}{Me got tophat here.}{}{-4}{in 3001}{100}{ }
{10}{Goodbye.}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{11}{Me go now.}{}{-4}{}{0}{ }
{13}{I sell armor and weapons of all kinds, as well as ammunition and explosives. Are you looking to trade?}{I sell armor and weapons of all kinds, as well as ammunition and explosives. Are you looking to trade?}{}{}{}{ }
{14}{B:}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{20}{Quite frankly, yes. I used to supplement my income with a little adventuring, but I'm getting too old for that now. I got a real juicy tip recently.}{Quite frankly, yes. I used to supplement my income with a little adventuring, but I'm getting too old for that now. I got a real juicy tip recently.}{}{}{}{ }
{21}{Can you tell me about it?}{}{5}{}{30}{qu 1263 1, qu 1264 1, lf4 1}
{22}{Maybe later.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{25}{Walter was here, spoke to a few folks, and left. I know he spoke to the Landers on the west side of town, and I have not seen them around much since. Bara lives next door to them; she may know more.}{Walter was here, spoke to a few folks, and left. I know he spoke to the Landers on the west side of town, and I have not seen them around much since. Bara lives next door to them; she may know more.}{}{}{}{ }
{26}{Thanks. I had another question.}{}{5}{}{1}{ }
{30}{Wink Rathburn was an adventurer who settled here before he died. Rumor says he was buried near his lair on the Dark River, along with his loot. John Engstrom, the innmistress's late husband, may have known where.}{Wink Rathburn was an adventurer who settled here before he died. Rumor says he was buried near his lair on the Dark River, along with his loot. John Engstrom, the innmistress's late husband, may have known where.}{}{}{}{ }
{31}{And you want me to find out where Wink was buried.}{}{5}{}{40}{ }
{32}{So?}{}{-4}{}{40}{ }
{40}{Precisely.}{Precisely.}{}{}{}{ }
{41}{Where do I start?}{}{5}{}{45}{ }
{45}{There may be something in old John Engstrom's belongings. His widow, Phoebe Engstrom, may be able to help you at the inn. Convincing her may be difficult.}{There may be something in old John Engstrom's belongings. His widow, Phoebe Engstrom, may be able to help you at the inn. Convincing her may be difficult.}{}{}{}{ }
{46}{Why is that?}{}{5}{}{50}{qu 1263 2, qu 1264 2}
{47}{Why dat?}{}{-4}{}{50}{qu 1263 2, qu 1264 2}
{50}{She is a money-grubber. Any scent of profit and she will demand a share. I only want one thing: Wink had a mechanical Tophat I was fond of. If you find it, bring it to me and I will pay 200 coin.}{She is a money-grubber. Any scent of profit and she will demand a share. I only want one thing: Wink had a mechanical Tophat I was fond of. If you find it, bring it to me and I will pay 200 coin.}{}{}{}{ }
{51}{I will look into it.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{52}{Me find it.}{}{-4}{}{0}{ }
{55}{You wanted to talk to me about the job?}{You wanted to talk to me about the job?}{}{}{}{ }
{56}{Yes. Remind me what I need to do.}{}{5}{}{60}{ }
{57}{Me need remember job.}{}{-4}{}{60}{ }
{60}{Talk with Phoebe Engstrom at the inn and look for anything that points to the Dark River. Once you know where it is, come back to me.}{Talk with Phoebe Engstrom at the inn and look for anything that points to the Dark River. Once you know where it is, come back to me.}{}{}{}{ }
{61}{Understood.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{90}{That twisted shit. I recall he was headed north, to Tull. I hope you show him no mercy when you catch up to him.}{That twisted shit. I recall he was headed north, to Tull. I hope you show him no mercy when you catch up to him.}{}{}{}{ }
{91}{Indeed. I had another question.}{}{5}{}{1}{ }
{100}{Congratulations. Now, if you will give me the tophat, our negotiations will be complete.}{Congratulations. Now, if you will give me the tophat, our negotiations will be complete.}{}{}{}{ }
{101}{Here it is.}{}{1}{in 3001}{-2}{qu 1263 4, gf3133 1}
{102}{I do not have it after all.}{}{5}{}{110}{ }
{104}{Actually, I am keeping it.}{}{5}{in 3001}{0}{qu 1263 6, re -5}
{110}{Please return when you have it, then.}{Please return when you have it, then.}{}{}{}{ }
{111}{I will.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{180}{Wonderful. Now get down there and recover the tophat for me.}{Wonderful. Now get down there and recover the tophat for me.}{}{}{}{ }
{181}{Why do you not do it?}{}{5}{}{185}{ }
{182}{I will.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{185}{Because that is what I am paying you for, remember?}{Because that is what I am paying you for, remember?}{}{}{}{ }
{186}{Right. I will go.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
